physicalRef: trade_circular_trade_links
description: "Trade-based money-laundering Link Analysis showcase - The link Dataset of the saved view circular_trade, derived from trade_links by the trade_circular_trade_links Job: the containers. shipped_in links of boxes flagged relayed (each leg's consignee ships the box on) or many_shippers, and the traded_with links between their shippers. Same columns as trade_links. Synthetic."
